This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The product images and attributes used by the demo come from the
"Fashion Product Images (Small)" dataset, obtained via the Hugging Face Hub
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/ashraq/fashion-product-images-small). That
dataset declares no explicit licence, so **no dataset images are redistributed
in this repository**; `scripts/prepare_sample.py` downloads them on demand.
See `data/README.md` for full provenance, including which catalogue fields are
real, which are derived, and which are synthetic.

Model weights are downloaded at runtime from the Hugging Face Hub and remain
subject to their own licences (the default, `openai/clip-vit-base-patch32`, is
MIT-licensed).
